RuleModule: DetroitBzaDecisionFinality
ImportOntology: DetroitBzaDecisionFinality
Provision: OrdinaryFinality
  PropositionId: detroit:article-ii:section-50-2-79:ordinary-finality
  SourceSpan: ordinary | Decisions that are rendered by the Board of Zoning Appeals shall not become final until 4:00 p.m. on the third business day after the vote,
  AppliesWhen: (decidedBy(decision, DetroitBZA) && renderedByVote(decision, vote) && !CertifiedImmediateEffect(decision))
  FinalAt: atTime(addBusinessDays(date(occurredAt(vote)), 3), 16:00)
Provision: CertifiedImmediateEffect
  PropositionId: detroit:article-ii:section-50-2-79:immediate-effect-exception
  SourceSpan: exception | unless the Board finds the immediate effect of such order necessary for the preservation of property or personal rights and so certifies on the record.
  Overrides: OrdinaryFinality
  AppliesWhen: (decidedBy(decision, DetroitBZA) && findingFor(finding, decision) && necessaryToPreserve(finding, PropertyRights || PersonalRights) && certifiedBy(finding, recordCertification))
  FinalAt: occurredAt(voteRendering(decision))
